---
permalink: /brand/
lang: en
layout: base.njk
pagekey: brand
noindex: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
# Unlisted brand kit for Patrick. Files live in linkedin/img (published as /brand/img/) and src/brand/.
sections:
  - h: Your LinkedIn profile
    grid: one
    items:
      - h: Profile banner
        size: 3168 × 792 px
        p: The background image at the top of your profile. Click the edit icon on the background image and upload the file. Your profile photo covers the bottom left, so the text sits on the right.
        img: img/novacoach-banner-en.png
        files: [[Norwegian, img/novacoach-banner-no.png], [English, img/novacoach-banner-en.png]]
  - h: The NovaCoach page on LinkedIn
    grid: two
    items:
      - h: Page logo
        size: 800 × 800 px
        p: The square logo for the company page.
        img: img/novacoach-logo.png
        files: [[PNG, img/novacoach-logo.png]]
      - h: Cover image
        size: 4200 × 700 px
        p: The wide image at the top of the page. The text sits in the middle, because the logo covers the bottom left and phones crop the sides.
        img: img/novacoach-cover-en.png
        files: [[Norwegian, img/novacoach-cover-no.png], [English, img/novacoach-cover-en.png]]
  - h: Images for posts
    lead: All 1080 × 1350 px, portrait.
    grid: three
    items:
      - h: Changing lanes.
        p: Announces NovaCoach.
        img: img/novacoach-launch-en.png
        files: [[Norwegian, img/novacoach-launch-no.png], [English, img/novacoach-launch-en.png]]
      - h: 38 years of Novapoint.
        p: Your career as a timeline, 1988 to 2026.
        img: img/novacoach-farewell-en.png
        files: [[Norwegian, img/novacoach-farewell-no.png], [English, img/novacoach-farewell-en.png]]
      - h: Hire 38 years of Novapoint.
        p: What you offer, in three parts.
        img: img/novacoach-services-en.png
        files: [[Norwegian, img/novacoach-services-no.png], [English, img/novacoach-services-en.png]]
      - h: Learn Novapoint on your own project.
        p: The courses and how long they take.
        img: img/novacoach-offer-en.png
        files: [[Norwegian, img/novacoach-offer-no.png], [English, img/novacoach-offer-en.png]]
      - h: Tips ahead.
        p: Opens a series of practical tips.
        img: img/novacoach-tips-en.png
        files: [[Norwegian, img/novacoach-tips-no.png], [English, img/novacoach-tips-en.png]]
      - h: Quote
        p: For a personal post about why you started NovaCoach.
        img: img/novacoach-quote-en.png
        files: [[Norwegian, img/novacoach-quote-no.png], [English, img/novacoach-quote-en.png]]
  - h: Link preview
    grid: one
    items:
      - h: Shared links to novacoach.no
        size: 1200 × 630 px
        p: What LinkedIn, Teams and email show when someone shares a link to the site. The site already uses it, so there is nothing to upload. It also works as a wide image in a post or an email.
        img: img/novacoach-og-en.png
        files: [[Norwegian, img/novacoach-og-no.png], [English, img/novacoach-og-en.png]]
  - h: Logo
    lead: Keep the proportions, leave some space around it, and keep the colours as they are.
    grid: two
    items:
      - h: Logo for light backgrounds
        size: 2400 × 500 px, transparent
        p: For email signatures, documents and slides.
        img: img/novacoach-wordmark.png
        files: [[PNG, img/novacoach-wordmark.png]]
      - h: Logo for dark backgrounds
        size: 2400 × 500 px, transparent
        p: For dark slides and photos.
        img: img/novacoach-wordmark-light.png
        bg: dark
        files: [[PNG, img/novacoach-wordmark-light.png]]
      - h: Symbol
        size: 512 × 512 px, or SVG
        p: The N as a road, for places where the full logo does not fit, such as an icon. The SVG stays sharp at any size, so give it to whoever prints.
        img: novacoach-mark.svg
        files: [[PNG, novacoach-mark-512.png], [SVG, novacoach-mark.svg]]
      - h: Symbol without background
        size: SVG
        p: The same symbol without the light square, for light backgrounds.
        img: novacoach-mark-no-plate.svg
        files: [[SVG, novacoach-mark-no-plate.svg]]
colours:
  - [Yellow, "#F0C43C", "The centre line. Use it for one highlight, not for large areas."]
  - [Asphalt, "#14171B", "Text and dark backgrounds."]
  - [Paper, "#F4F1EA", "Light backgrounds."]
---
<section class="wrap block page-head">
  <h1>Brand kit</h1>
  <p class="lead">Logos and images for LinkedIn, email and documents. Click a button to download the file. Most images come in a Norwegian and an English version.</p>
  <p class="note">This page is not in the site menu. Bookmark it, or keep the link.</p>
</section>
{%- for s in sections %}
<section class="wrap block kit">
  <div class="kit-head">
    <h2>{{ s.h }}</h2>
    {%- if s.lead %}<p class="lead">{{ s.lead }}</p>{% endif %}
  </div>
  <div class="kit-grid {{ s.grid }}">
    {%- for i in s.items %}
    <figure class="asset">
      <a class="asset-img{% if i.bg == 'dark' %} on-dark{% endif %}" href="/brand/{{ i.img }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/brand/{{ i.img }}" alt="{{ i.h }}" loading="lazy"></a>
      <figcaption>
        <h3>{{ i.h }}</h3>
        {%- if i.size %}<p class="small">{{ i.size }}</p>{% endif %}
        <p>{{ i.p }}</p>
        <p class="asset-dl">
          {%- for f in i.files %}
          <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-small" href="/brand/{{ f[1] }}" download><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v8M4 6.5 8 10.5l4-4M3 14h10"/></svg>{{ f[0] }}</a>
          {%- endfor %}
        </p>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{%- endfor %}
<section class="wrap block kit">
  <div class="kit-head">
    <h2>Colours and fonts</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="swatches">
    {%- for c in colours %}
    <div class="swatch"><div class="chip" style="background: {{ c[1] }}"></div><p><b>{{ c[0] }}</b> {{ c[1] }}<br><span class="small">{{ c[2] }}</span></p></div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="kit-fonts">Headings and the logo use <a href="https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Archivo" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Archivo</a>, body text uses <a href="https://fonts.google.com/specimen/IBM+Plex+Sans" rel="noopener" target="_blank">IBM Plex Sans</a>. Both are free from Google Fonts. In Word and PowerPoint, Arial works as a stand-in if they are not installed.</p>
</section>
